{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1396,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b8ad44dcacdffc58c7577e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68e822021704de2d0b17450911975e3353a641db970893dc695ab5dee7eda4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df49d4396ba248b89b01252b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我得……再更加磨练自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cabb266526b82032108b1f6948eb63e960f2a65a07daa9b87b595e8055d2c4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b01e7759bf36a0375f6e298",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定能更加闪耀的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6b84f792f3f828f8d336b405cc731f12413d67e78d7d86e2dc8062c59619cc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec6cbd488349be83f9b94441",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来这次勉强保住光芒了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12b34b2fc96ca0a5a7773f869ec96bd1465221c3343c1b38d9ec7089ec81f336",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2506d3668239500b29a6863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我会将这次的结果谨记在心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4116ba682ce78b759bfba047a0a8e6a8d71332fb84b9db573343d27add49b51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b41bad78f04fca19903b205e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因我坚持相信自己存在的意义、\r\n自己出生的意义……才有这番成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e91871455919314cb246006a80e7a909bd077af8a8f372b1f962351b4a83bd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feecc5e9eef64e10d7d9752d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光钻的光芒看起来如何啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f67249f39190a62531afb9aed85db4f815d38daa67e9c3511348ef33e98453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1075b6b25e0665521c1d3cc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利的朝阳在此升起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bad09eb1aa16c2463434976f0ab993ba6532fe738a483d9b9de47aefe3a329a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada8d4448576573b2cd946d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光钻的光芒看起来如何呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7620713ba735c166963c239abaf94c16eaedf46adde2b9e01e094c51878b5cf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21b2cc71ffc40842e52c44d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "矜持はここに、誇りはここに。そして、勝利も！",
      "source_fingerprint": "daeb622f8a586ff19572082bcb597def95897f7c225b1201da2f1274b6e98c63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f9b25ad1ec54d483dca8c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダイヤの輝き、いかがでしたか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5fc59cd2a95d3bc4edad45e1b39bb2d20c8a3d5e54ca32e10be4d27586ab91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3914c739a13b8ee7088a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绽放光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "939f1ee158d9b76d470670404c9b882e5d8756049ab47254d2b7212269c6a14c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccfd6a6f3f912d3a4ee88e4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正是绽放光芒之时！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c6c7ff6a744f7209e2374d7969f6ccb562c0cef5f65013f1f018dfcc3af3e44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abd462558566dac4156323b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小北……\r\n看起来跟平常不太一样，对吧？\r\n她是怎么了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "579cebe1373c74d9bb1f53fee454be8ecc4a997f8599c47da7da767b322ed6be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8384ebc3f5a3346985aebdb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家热热闹闹的，玩得好开心！\r\n看来可以跟他们请教很多\r\n不懂的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "243fdcdffe5b867dbf5a517f741563cfafdfdb9a21d554ef8d3e9aca07c371cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65234fd603b4dab7f3027ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金船总是会提出我从没想过的\r\n练习方式！我受到很多刺激，\r\n学到很多呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17306305b9c9ca8ed7c4c31004b35f5c3c37a060d129dbb5ac027d5a1a8cfa80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596920c879665f54945c01d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诗歌剧她该不会\r\n远比我们想象的还要更……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3f88a0883f4c113d0f036aca5e3f14e7ee73a06502936f2a36bacadff401453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3d9b7823b5a191fbe2c78f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园的「魔物」……\r\n希望有一天能亲眼看看本尊呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5350afd7b0920b1cc1b6d8cc3b7c31fbe1fefa513b9998107ea7744021794a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f151d565aaf6deb47b1907ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我胸中这道希望之光──\r\n现在，照亮属于我的道路吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de204086e0fedccbf74f514c60da260776b5ec029881d9ab473037bd32bee8c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73cc7dea0b6a754168f6b2dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "写给父亲大人及母亲大人……\r\n「光钻会和小北一起加油的。」\r\n……呵呵，好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bfd3ec4db6df74eae10661174a5848957cfe6211f4992289b2bd0fee5d4a942",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b2b49632a57dd9c7d7bdb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝阳啊，升起吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2004146f74a4c4b17aacd04e5722fa909f36f614701895ddc71e261f72d318f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0b13f09434dc24a1d3dbe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一定会在日出前爬上巅峰。\r\n因为大家都是那么用心地\r\n在替我们加油打气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c80f972b189fc1fbce205b8c3fd336613c5a0a4ba29d88e56ff9816fe7eb47b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef6afc141afa44622a8d0beb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是多黑暗的夜晚……\r\n都必定会结束！曙光出现了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1518cd1a4b4bad42f543d4c39185164c13203375aa3117b41982f2a1699024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:839ab8b7a2f91d6d93bd7160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年会抽到什么签呢……？\r\n呵呵，无论运势如何，\r\n我都会亲手掌握幸福♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b50992edb5877469be5d62dea33f59222d21408ef0f0c1e5a7fd2e048649f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ce024cace1faa1ca2ac2a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越えてみせる…すべてを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0323c34a194c097a82ce57d2c09b09b001325485ee6b885900f3076c0d9a3467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c949026dc6e9754a3bc6459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぬかるみも茨も、遥かな壁も…すべて！\r\n私が越えるためにある！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d2dbcce937eb2422730573122bde1c8ec5fc16e75de287c2c61a713848258cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a75a808b79e60d07d4b60d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感到一股不同于比赛的紧张感呢。\r\n……呵呵，我的心跳开始加快了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccdafe587a6ec4e5f84aa0b465012791d64c10257ad6411061530da99b9c98d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd63c2b65ff9fdc148c8929",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看着我在舞台上\r\n闪耀光芒的身影！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0bd6d5c87717820b79bec94203e9452472f904a5703ac7cdf5c97ec936e0563",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c141d5fc0a1a5c76e39e707",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小女子不才，还请多多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af364d3fe7fb8b19f667aacc311692de144f04f77daed3277ce9af14068c8423",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c285dd09b4a11a8023c9652",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为训练员你\r\n理解我的梦想，\r\n所以我才决定要跟你一起前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04362c8ad96e89c5021e7d879971eba0957f29b328fdb8ed9e2ae4f3c800524e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0bf82a41e85980eeede22f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园中满是各种有趣的事物。\r\n看来我可以度过快乐的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b9013d0b3c8a02ebfe58caf20a8c31e1779dbe12fbc6397d6c47dfa6c9ab44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ff97e447ce63df16e24b84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这样穿……是正确的吗？\r\n穿上露肚子的衣服对我来说很新鲜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98be02baf2f924fa125b697adb862134641d128fb91960c652a2c533c605f1d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a380d4a16ce08138788d920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "钻石将绽放光芒──\r\n既坚强又优美，无比闪耀的光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "660d975f5f751514da2fd2329ae2acd213ed4d160070a108c9e7f4cf36d3da50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0668e0829652f61140389da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然我已经穿上这套制服，\r\n接下来可就无法收手了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef587b9cfbc79221d0b44db4a890d501bcbb066788df7e3aa1ac1253e44b967",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c91056852cae171ae36760f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站上舞台能令人更加闪耀。\r\n所以我会全力以赴，绝不懈怠♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c44ed6a8b055a8892fa84d7e378f925e56a8d171f6222772c24a2e1d93a54507",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599ae1efd0f83cda1077b799",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "柔美的荷叶边能为我增添华丽气息。\r\n但前提是我自己要先绽放光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "249d3672eba89845eac1aaa1a636abf7fbb0f73412bc59e0b19d19c9f1a8afbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca85a36406d5827661f6e47e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这丰富的色彩，\r\n让人觉得能度过清新的一年呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96387f36ebe72312980a63591cd40152add36036acba18e80b5848b830a2074",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1da10d92827d198bc7c700e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会抵达耀眼的巅峰……\r\n我感觉到了那样的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c87fe746d05326249c187c508e108776b9a3b4a2e340ff7be1ba00cd2153030",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f4571632d1740599a70d78e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？适合我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "587d4810e9777d4061316f8b6e50f8bc787c4031edf6dd846afa8760985812a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16f66a496c850668dbc014ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要放进展示柜里♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f1c25471f72eb882c3328f2cfc083be01edba0bcbe926d42f0401e1fde8183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbce3af7e864777dc484a35a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你打算去哪里呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7078a96644618ab8d3c0b36a9ffbfa9dfc0eaa58be151c6331c9214ffb7648",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60066122350ca187686d92e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身打扮根本跑不动……\r\n那不过是种魔咒，我不会受影响喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e343d8ab80e9d068fb509e49c6480b53a7e74cf8df28d998d0b3a62c1d11c0c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:841ebc718cc9198bca1b7c52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇猛そうに見えるでしょう？\r\n事実、勇気りんりんですっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e45491b1b42567f33367d5c0a8ce0a4a8a38cf5bb7f81f8c97c77366ffa2108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fd6051342d0613f0f2cf1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晴れ舞台ですもの、普段より\r\nちょっぴりカッコよく参りましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fdb667bc07b150b8078277f77a147229509604c2dd26d082484c59b287e67a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:073a45349acd07433f6bdd95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园中满是各种有趣的事物。\r\n看来我可以度过快乐的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b9013d0b3c8a02ebfe58caf20a8c31e1779dbe12fbc6397d6c47dfa6c9ab44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d99c7d74776d626a232f3783",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这样穿……是正确的吗？\r\n穿上露肚子的衣服对我来说很新鲜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98be02baf2f924fa125b697adb862134641d128fb91960c652a2c533c605f1d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c9d137d4dda754606d7fa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "钻石将绽放光芒──\r\n既坚强又优美，无比闪耀的光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "660d975f5f751514da2fd2329ae2acd213ed4d160070a108c9e7f4cf36d3da50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0a18e13a62a113858ad9476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然我已经穿上这套制服，\r\n接下来可就无法收手了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef587b9cfbc79221d0b44db4a890d501bcbb066788df7e3aa1ac1253e44b967",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a665017fda33f894e6fe71b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站上舞台能令人更加闪耀。\r\n所以我会全力以赴，绝不懈怠♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c44ed6a8b055a8892fa84d7e378f925e56a8d171f6222772c24a2e1d93a54507",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd06b89d77aa409b1964f7d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "柔美的荷叶边能为我增添华丽气息。\r\n但前提是我自己要先绽放光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "249d3672eba89845eac1aaa1a636abf7fbb0f73412bc59e0b19d19c9f1a8afbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ed99c914841efa8dd024057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这丰富的色彩，\r\n让人觉得能度过清新的一年呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96387f36ebe72312980a63591cd40152add36036acba18e80b5848b830a2074",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46f9ef8b83d6394a399d2ecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会抵达耀眼的巅峰……\r\n我感觉到了那样的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c87fe746d05326249c187c508e108776b9a3b4a2e340ff7be1ba00cd2153030",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90039dc230e598ecb0f1f7ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？适合我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "587d4810e9777d4061316f8b6e50f8bc787c4031edf6dd846afa8760985812a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a7b8a6b858e99b85bf77e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要放进展示柜里♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f1c25471f72eb882c3328f2cfc083be01edba0bcbe926d42f0401e1fde8183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:632c2890f1cded905c09b7c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇猛そうに見えるでしょう？\r\n事実、勇気りんりんですっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e45491b1b42567f33367d5c0a8ce0a4a8a38cf5bb7f81f8c97c77366ffa2108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9bfed4a4211b8317266cdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晴れ舞台ですもの、普段より\r\nちょっぴりカッコよく参りましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fdb667bc07b150b8078277f77a147229509604c2dd26d082484c59b287e67a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f87eae5c215f28811da69a86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:720a0880423b796fe3727aea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダイヤはとても硬い宝石です。\r\nそれを打ち砕くというのですね？\r\nふふ、わかりました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61fcc19807cd4c57ad6980fbedcc7544d75efda3e55b7c7ae4a92050e2c03445",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1fb8121ead64ba595c397aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まあ、すごいお力…！\r\nでしたら私ももっと\r\n輝いてみせましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24be0cfc17de36145aaf793d0a3beadb6a9691f13b0a69620219195aa71075e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2604d76a81766ece3f69a6cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n请问今天要从事\r\n什么挑战呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a052a75a2c312ffff70b840cdfed68e339fa7f8844a409b5dfa6dc487b67673",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9663ba82c0a760be671037d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早上都会跟小北一起做发声练习。\r\n所以我对自已明亮且充满精神的\r\n招呼声很有自信喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cec184290f61f7bb50cb23dc8d6d1e62ddb47af33162e2bd7c15aca26a2378b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1174ac4ba511986d848bd110",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟朋友一起品尝好茶，\r\n一起努力训练……\r\n呵呵，今天真是美好的一天呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d444e399f5779fe8bdc3082d01942ee90eabbb8df0d5987b13c935e0bf5d0097",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:407288fe87ee1f2e5df84627",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以去学园外面跑一下吗？\r\n我想跟附近邻居们\r\n更加增进感情♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "16417c204440e4251d29ed6905a395d47d84931d85852c7e102f25fa300610ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c33ddb4a127ebad1f436f62e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都这么晚了你还在埋头工作啊。\r\n我也该向你看齐，学习你那\r\n总是认真努力的态度！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09b5945d97db08ac58806dc36d986ee3e84e20278a4e3e74508ee204c0fdd8c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9101bc277fdc2d99c6b8fa0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回去后跟小北一起写作业吧♪\r\n我觉得两个人一起写\r\n能更快写完呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "965a3e11e23f5d494388dc4034beedc366ba90ee1b9de7a9468c86c0618d2c53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c4f773ad60a05a5459d8ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天天气真好，很适合打高尔夫呢。\r\n让我回想起以前曾经为了赢过父亲，\r\n在球场坚持好几轮的回忆呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "51068b38285e7dbba96ba9c2e7a76fd88736dd33d207859341f91b4e2224ed0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:285e2a7123992b96bf274f52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我常在夏季前往避暑胜地别墅，\r\n在大自然中奔跑。或许当时的经验\r\n也成了我的养分喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb5c8f05f057974d0a6aa69af603f3013f3de4657ed19aaf9c94dbc021bc2485",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced1d0ed2116a8abd1f57f12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时期，我家庭院里会开出壮观的\r\n菊花……那凛然伫立的姿态\r\n总令我看得入迷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c40bb5e751773ddf3896e1c8dee34f9b89b89b0c3c6e7f79c1cc456d02d4521",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b92944b514ff516e95e09d2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我第一次跟小北一起看比赛是在\r\n年底的时候。那天的场景……\r\n我到现在还记得一清二楚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fcb96aa585bb0a93fb578b17cb25f01749613df70678ee5cbb2e0540a643462",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4812e74c1f07f041499843",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的一天又开始了。\r\n开头比什么都重要。\r\n绷紧神经出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16107893e81a39a01d50879a1ffefbcab779dd15239f8edfe961f7a34dde84d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cccdbe9533a719a0cf8a516f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使不是元旦，早起看朝阳\r\n还是能够洗涤心灵呢！\r\n希望今天也能度过美好的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adfbe4d5cb8a4093f36dc629868b23a8d56d4e0a084ae707edc5320faab5fc0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b7329441e709c41e085c27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不晓得是不是因为吃了年糕，\r\n肚子现在还是很饱。\r\n年糕真的可以让人饱很久呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76cb9691ed6627e0f3ba74595e60fece0e2a31b074b2de9582085d7ab424932e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c24ee9e2b15e2129aa3b542",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿着这件衣服，\r\n就会莫名地想吃日式料理呢。\r\n这是神明的旨意吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2d459388715196f93da6a7975a8cb71aee47839308076584c560e73e94555e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26d04c45d1da3ef2daaed63c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走夜路的时候请小心。\r\n啊，不介意的话……\r\n我借你夜视镜吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc1986e6852a585a6e78a0969d9f58c8a221c9c46f9ff99038738725ccbd4200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7728d5fd226eaa5ec634d55e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你觉得累了，要不要来杯\r\n热甜酒？甜酒很有营养喔。\r\n呵呵，我晚点去帮你倒一杯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ecf28d7bf1bfe2a634f67567da5983fa54cbd0e54553c7b733e56d79a04d3e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba1764bf48cfa7ee6b18e1ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿巫女服迎接新生们……\r\n春天充满了新的邂逅，\r\n让人按捺不住好奇心呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57286f2109ee9a3c672412fba9d1110dc05c2cc78c6c14e789de06e31bc00bda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc7d9e534c6ac6444a4028da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服夏天穿也很凉。\r\n啊，但脖子周围要小心晒伤。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ca2d8790719722f4959042fe746b4c02cc7205abaafca5d641c450221da86ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4adb7c2f37bb27433eb0b90a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了树叶开始变色的季节。\r\n那间神社里结的柿子，\r\n差不多可以吃了吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec75d186673b6ebc7bc7c39fd35eb0f8f78545b003ce345ed8ebff7c27c5b19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7f9dfd9ba9bfe289a56dee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和穿巫女服的小北打雪仗，\r\n一定会陷入苦战。因为她穿得\r\n一身白，根本找不到她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca5741ecf3d0bd48f23573b489ce5474101310069331b5d9c1ee11cfe38a54c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6122d8248af1703d58cf161",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90020"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
